          "text": "Step 1: Create an SMS campaign"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/41072420801819-How-to-create-an-RCS-campaign-in-Klaviyo#h_01K56X1RTMH7BEFRQ2GM58B33N",
          "text": "Step 2: Select your audience"
